  <h2>Build three messages from shuffled chunks</h2><div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="practice" data-tile-builder data-answer="Could you please confirm whether the north entrance will be step-free on October 14" data-hint="Begin with the request frame, then add the embedded whether clause and its date." data-fix="Could you please confirm whether the north entrance will be step-free on October 14?" data-success-message="Correct. The external request names the action, exact entrance, access condition, and date."><h3>1. External access request</h3><p>Ask the venue coordinator to confirm one condition for the workshop.</p><div class="build-bank" data-build-bank><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="Could you">Could you</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="please confirm">please confirm</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="whether">whether</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="the north entrance">the north entrance</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="will be">will be</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="step-free">step-free</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="on October 14">on October 14</button></div><div class="build-area" data-build-area data-placeholder="Tap chunks to build the external request."></div><div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-build>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-build>Reset</button></div><p class="feedback" data-feedback></p></div>
  <div class="practice" data-tile-builder data-answer="I understand the cost concern however the current plan does not include the required accessibility review" data-hint="Build common ground first, then contrast it with the precise missing requirement." data-fix="I understand the cost concern; however, the current plan does not include the required accessibility review." data-success-message="Correct. The disagreement acknowledges the concern and then states a specific evidence-based problem."><h3>2. Professional disagreement</h3><p>Challenge the plan without attacking the person who proposed it.</p><div class="build-bank" data-build-bank><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="I understand">I understand</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="the cost concern">the cost concern</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="however">however</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="the current plan">the current plan</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="does not include">does not include</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="the required">the required</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="accessibility review">accessibility review</button></div><div class="build-area" data-build-area data-placeholder="Tap chunks to build the disagreement."></div><div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-build>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-build>Reset</button></div><p class="feedback" data-feedback></p></div>
  <div class="practice" data-tile-builder data-answer="We sent duplicate cancellation emails to 38 attendees their registrations remain active" data-hint="Name the organizational action and affected group before the supported reassurance." data-fix="We sent duplicate cancellation emails to 38 attendees; their registrations remain active." data-success-message="Correct. The correction owns the communication failure and preserves the unaffected registration status."><h3>3. Accountable public correction</h3><p>Name the organization’s action, bounded scope, and supported reassurance.</p><div class="build-bank" data-build-bank><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="We sent">We sent</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="duplicate cancellation emails">duplicate cancellation emails</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="to 38 attendees">to 38 attendees</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="their registrations">their registrations</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="remain active">remain active</button></div><div class="build-area" data-build-area data-placeholder="Tap chunks to build the correction."></div><div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-build>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-build>Reset</button></div><p class="feedback" data-feedback></p></div>

  <h2>Repair four register failures</h2><div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="wanna" data-hint="The greeting and external request are professional, but one reduced lexical form belongs to very informal speech." data-fix="Hello Ms. Lee, I would like to ask whether you could send the signed agreement by Friday." data-why="Want to is commonly reduced to wanna in casual speech, but would like to fits this external professional request. The repair also makes the deadline explicit." data-success-message="Correct. The request now uses a consistent external professional register and an exact deadline."><h3>Repair 1: mixed register</h3><p>Tap the phrase that conflicts with the external email.</p><div class="spot-options"><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="hello">Hello Ms. Lee,</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="i">I</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="wanna">wanna ask</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="could">whether you could send</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="agreement">the signed agreement.</button></div><p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p></div>
  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="wondering" data-hint="Smoke is present. Remove the extended negotiation frame and make the safety action immediate." data-fix="Leave through the east exit now." data-why="An emergency instruction should minimize interpretive work. The imperative is proportionate to the risk and does not become impolite simply because it is direct." data-success-message="Correct. The emergency instruction now foregrounds immediate action and the safe route."><h3>Repair 2: excessive mitigation in an emergency</h3><p>Tap the phrase that delays the required action.</p><div class="spot-options"><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="wondering">I was wondering whether you might perhaps consider</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="leaving">leaving</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="east">through the east exit</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="now">now.</button></div><p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p></div>
  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="was activated" data-hint="The investigation identifies the scheduling team, so preserve that relevant actor." data-fix="Our scheduling team activated the wrong automation rule at 9:10." data-why="The passive hides a known responsible actor. An accountable record can name the team without turning the sentence into a personal attack." data-success-message="Correct. The record now preserves supported agency, action, and time."><h3>Repair 3: hidden responsibility</h3><p>Tap the phrase that erases the established actor.</p><div class="spot-options"><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="wrong">The wrong automation rule</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="was activated">was activated</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="time">at 9:10,</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="known">although the responsible team is known.</button></div><p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p></div>
  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="utilization" data-hint="Replace hidden and inflated wording with a direct subject, verb, and object." data-fix="We used the revised checklist to review the entrance." data-why="Formal prose can use ordinary verbs. The original wording hides two actions inside abstract nouns and makes the reader work harder." data-success-message="Correct. The formal sentence is now concise, active, and easy to act on."><h3>Repair 4: inflated formality</h3><p>Tap the phrase that contains the clearest unnecessary inflation.</p><div class="spot-options"><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="we">We</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="facilitated">facilitated</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="utilization">the utilization of the revised checklist</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="review">for the purpose of conducting a review.</button></div><p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p></div>

  <h2>Rehearse fast shifts aloud</h2><div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="practice" data-transform><p class="note-line">Respond before revealing. State the audience, relationship, channel, purpose, and stakes that justify your choice.</p><div class="transform-list">
    <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>1</b> Ask a familiar teammate for the updated link without inventing urgency.</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>Can you send me the updated link when you have a minute?</strong></p></div>
    <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>2</b> Ask an external coordinator to confirm the step-free entrance by 3:00 p.m.</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>Could you please confirm by 3:00 p.m. whether the north entrance will be step-free?</strong></p></div>
    <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>3</b> Disagree with a claim based on twelve users without attacking the researcher.</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>The result is promising; however, a sample of twelve users does not yet support a general conclusion.</strong></p></div>
    <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>4</b> Report Cedar Loop’s error with responsibility, scope, and one unaffected system.</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>Our scheduling team activated the wrong rule, which sent duplicate cancellation emails to 38 of 240 attendees; registration records remained active.</strong></p></div>
    <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>5</b> Give the Cedar Loop staging result without turning it into a live guarantee.</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>The corrected rule produced no duplicates in 60 fictional staging accounts, but live reliability remains unverified.</strong></p></div>
    <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>6</b> Deliver a literal emergency direction with action and safe route prominent.</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>LEAVE now | through the EAST exit.</strong></p></div>
  </div></div>

  <h2>Practice register without private disclosure</h2><div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <p>You never need to reveal a real workplace conflict, disciplinary event, medical matter, immigration process, legal dispute, financial problem, family relationship, discrimination experience, confidential message, or power imbalance. Use Cedar Loop, a public notice, or a tutor-created situation. The skill is making language fit an explicit communicative situation, not proving that you know a hidden social code.</p>
  <div class="prompt-card"><b>Audience switch:</b> Keep one fact stable while addressing a familiar coworker, unfamiliar partner, affected customer, and public reviewer. Explain what each person already knows.</div>
  <div class="prompt-card"><b>Power audit:</b> Decide whether the listener can genuinely refuse. Rebuild false optionality as an honest requirement, or make real choice visible.</div>
  <div class="prompt-card"><b>Plain-language edit:</b> Replace three inflated nouns or verbs, restore any relevant actor, and preserve the original evidence strength.</div>
  <div class="prompt-card"><b>Spoken shift:</b> Deliver one request warmly, one correction contrastively, and one safety direction firmly. Change prominence, not every word.</div>
  <div class="prompt-card"><b>Repair move:</b> If a listener hears you as blunt, distant, vague, or overly familiar, name your purpose and reformulate instead of defending one expression as universally correct.</div>

  <h2>Final production and check</h2><div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card"><h3>Final production: one event, four accountable messages</h3><p>Use Cedar Loop or a new fictional event. Establish the event, date, people or teams, action, affected group, unaffected systems, immediate repair, current evidence, uncertainty, and next update. Produce four versions: a familiar internal chat, a neutral-professional partner email, a public correction, and a formal incident record. Keep supported facts stable while changing reference, organization, explicitness, vocabulary, grammar, and spoken delivery.</p><p>Include one ordinary request, one honest requirement or urgent direction, one professional disagreement, and one apology or refusal. Use a contraction naturally in one professional version. Use one phrasal verb only where its meaning and channel fit, then give a plain lexical alternative. Choose active or passive voice from evidence and focus. Deliver one spoken version with thought groups, optional reduction, and contrastive prominence. Your listener changes one variable, such as power, urgency, shared context, or channel; revise immediately.</p><p><b>Listener check:</b> Can the listener identify the audience, relationship, role, purpose, channel, stakes, required action, deadline, agency, scope, and certainty? Does every mitigation serve a real interpersonal purpose? Does every formal choice remain clear?</p></div>
  <div class="quiz" data-quiz data-success-message="Correct. You preserved contextual register, honest directness, request grammar, relationship management, plain language, supported agency, spoken focus, and evidence boundaries."><h3>Seven final decisions</h3><div class="quiz-list">
    <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="Register is the situation-linked bundle of choices; formality is one dimension, and tone is the perceived interpersonal attitude." data-hint="Keep the broad language system, social-distance dimension, and perceived attitude distinct." data-fix="Register, formality, and tone overlap but are not synonyms."><p class="quiz-question">1. Which definition is accurate?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Register is the situation-linked bundle of choices; formality is one dimension, and tone is the perceived interpersonal attitude.">Register is the situation-linked bundle of choices; formality is one dimension, and tone is the perceived interpersonal attitude.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Register means replacing every short word with a longer synonym.">Register means replacing every short word with a longer synonym.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Tone, formality, and politeness always mean exactly the same thing.">Tone, formality, and politeness always mean exactly the same thing.</button></div></div>
    <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="Attendance is required because the session covers the safety procedure; contact me if you need an accessible format." data-hint="State the real obligation, reason, and available support instead of pretending attendance is optional." data-fix="The requirement is direct, transparent, and paired with support."><p class="quiz-question">2. A manager requires attendance. Which message represents the power relationship honestly?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Attendance is required because the session covers the safety procedure; contact me if you need an accessible format.">Attendance is required because the session covers the safety procedure; contact me if you need an accessible format.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Would you perhaps enjoy attending, although refusal will secretly be punished?">Would you perhaps enjoy attending, although refusal will secretly be punished?</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Yo, show up. No questions.">Yo, show up. No questions.</button></div></div>
    <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="I understand the timing concern; however, the proposed schedule omits the required accessibility review. Could we move the launch by two days?" data-hint="Choose common ground, a specific concern, and a workable alternative." data-fix="The response protects the relationship without hiding the disagreement."><p class="quiz-question">3. Which sentence is a defensible professional disagreement?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="I understand the timing concern; however, the proposed schedule omits the required accessibility review. Could we move the launch by two days?">I understand the timing concern; however, the proposed schedule omits the required accessibility review. Could we move the launch by two days?</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Your schedule is stupid, and you clearly do not care.">Your schedule is stupid, and you clearly do not care.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="I completely agree, so I will silently block the schedule later.">I completely agree, so I will silently block the schedule later.</button></div></div>
    <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="Our scheduling team activated the wrong rule, which sent duplicate emails to 38 attendees." data-hint="The source establishes the actor, action, and bounded affected group." data-fix="Use active voice here to preserve supported organizational responsibility."><p class="quiz-question">4. Which incident sentence preserves established agency and scope?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Our scheduling team activated the wrong rule, which sent duplicate emails to 38 attendees.">Our scheduling team activated the wrong rule, which sent duplicate emails to 38 attendees.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Mistakes were somehow made by nobody, and everyone was affected.">Mistakes were somehow made by nobody, and everyone was affected.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="One attendee intentionally destroyed all 240 payment records.">One attendee intentionally destroyed all 240 payment records.</button></div></div>
    <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="I'm writing to confirm that we've received your application." data-hint="Contractions can sound natural in many professional U.S. messages when the genre permits them." data-fix="The sentence is clear, warm, and professionally appropriate."><p class="quiz-question">5. Which sentence challenges the false rule that every professional message must avoid contractions?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="I'm writing to confirm that we've received your application.">I'm writing to confirm that we've received your application.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Yo, your app's here, dude.">Yo, your app's here, dude.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Receipt of the aforementioned application has heretofore been effectuated.">Receipt of the aforementioned application has heretofore been effectuated.</button></div></div>
    <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="The corrected rule produced no duplicates in 60 fictional staging accounts, but live reliability remains unverified." data-hint="Preserve the positive result, test environment, sample, and unresolved live question." data-fix="The staging evidence supports a bounded conclusion, not a guarantee."><p class="quiz-question">6. Which Cedar Loop conclusion is appropriately calibrated for a formal report?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The corrected rule produced no duplicates in 60 fictional staging accounts, but live reliability remains unverified.">The corrected rule produced no duplicates in 60 fictional staging accounts, but live reliability remains unverified.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The small staging test guarantees perfect live mail forever.">The small staging test guarantees perfect live mail forever.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Formal language proves that the test never occurred.">Formal language proves that the test never occurred.</button></div></div>
    <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="Could you CONFIRM it | by THREE?" data-hint="Group the request frame from the deadline and place main prominence on the new deadline." data-fix="Could you CONFIRM it | by THREE? foregrounds the required action and deadline naturally."><p class="quiz-question">7. Which spoken delivery makes a routine request’s action and deadline easy to recover?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Could you CONFIRM it | by THREE?">Could you CONFIRM it | by THREE?</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="COULD YOU CONFIRM IT BY THREE with equal heavy stress on every word">COULD YOU CONFIRM IT BY THREE with equal heavy stress on every word</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Whisper every deadline so it cannot sound direct">Whisper every deadline so it cannot sound direct</button></div></div>
  </div><div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-quiz>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-quiz>Reset</button></div><p class="feedback" data-feedback></p></div>

  <h2>Reflect: could this reader act correctly?</h2><div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card"><h3>Explain the choice, not only the label</h3><p>Complete these lines aloud: <span class="ex">My audience knows...</span> <span class="ex">Our relationship is...</span> <span class="ex">My role gives me...</span> <span class="ex">The message must...</span> <span class="ex">This channel expects...</span> <span class="ex">The consequence of ambiguity is...</span> <span class="ex">The listener can / cannot freely refuse...</span> <span class="ex">I named / omitted the actor because...</span> <span class="ex">The main spoken prominence belongs on...</span> <span class="ex">A plainer version would be...</span></p><p>Then change one variable. Rebuild the message instead of merely exchanging one “informal” word for one “formal” word.</p><p><a href="#next-day-retrieval">Return tomorrow for the five-item retrieval check</a> before rereading the lesson.</p></div>
  <div class="prompt-card"><b>Next use:</b> Before sending one real nonprivate message, write audience, relationship, role, purpose, channel, stakes, shared context, action, and deadline. Revise only the choices that do not serve that situation.</div>
  <section id="next-day-retrieval" data-lesson-extension="Next-day register-definition, honest-authority, accountable-agency, professional-contraction, and spoken-focus retrieval"><h2>Next-day retrieval</h2><div class="lead-rule"></div><p>Return without rereading. Reconstruct the decision system in five new fictional situations.</p>
    <div class="quiz" data-quiz data-success-message="Correct. You retained the register bundle, honest authority, supported agency, natural professional contraction, and deadline prominence."><h3>Five delayed decisions</h3><div class="quiz-list">
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="Audience, relationship, role, purpose, channel, stakes, and shared context together shape the register." data-hint="Recall the complete situation bundle instead of one formality label." data-fix="Register emerges from multiple interacting situation variables."><p class="quiz-question">1. Which principle should guide a new message first?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Audience, relationship, role, purpose, channel, stakes, and shared context together shape the register.">Audience, relationship, role, purpose, channel, stakes, and shared context together shape the register.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Count the syllables and choose whichever sentence is longest.">Count the syllables and choose whichever sentence is longest.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Use the same fixed greeting and tone for every person and emergency.">Use the same fixed greeting and tone for every person and emergency.</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="The inspection is required before entry because the equipment is safety-critical; contact us to arrange an accessible time." data-hint="State the obligation and reason, then make support available." data-fix="The message represents authority honestly while remaining respectful and usable."><p class="quiz-question">2. Which sentence communicates a real entry requirement appropriately?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The inspection is required before entry because the equipment is safety-critical; contact us to arrange an accessible time.">The inspection is required before entry because the equipment is safety-critical; contact us to arrange an accessible time.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Would you maybe inspect it if you feel like it, although entry is secretly impossible otherwise?">Would you maybe inspect it if you feel like it, although entry is secretly impossible otherwise?</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Do a thing soonish because reasons.">Do a thing soonish because reasons.</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="Our communications team sent the outdated schedule to 24 participants; we sent the corrected schedule at 2:15 p.m." data-hint="Use the established actor, bounded scope, problem, and repair." data-fix="The organization owns the supported action and names the correction."><p class="quiz-question">3. Which public correction preserves responsibility and scope?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Our communications team sent the outdated schedule to 24 participants; we sent the corrected schedule at 2:15 p.m.">Our communications team sent the outdated schedule to 24 participants; we sent the corrected schedule at 2:15 p.m.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Schedules happened, probably to everybody, and nobody knows anything.">Schedules happened, probably to everybody, and nobody knows anything.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The participants deliberately caused every internal error.">The participants deliberately caused every internal error.</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="We've attached the revised agreement, and we'd appreciate your response by Friday." data-hint="Choose a natural professional U.S. sentence whose contractions preserve clarity and respect." data-fix="Professional English can be contracted, warm, and clear when the genre permits it."><p class="quiz-question">4. Which sentence is a natural neutral-professional follow-up?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="We've attached the revised agreement, and we'd appreciate your response by Friday.">We've attached the revised agreement, and we'd appreciate your response by Friday.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Yo, sign this thing whenever.">Yo, sign this thing whenever.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The attachment's attachment has herein been attachmentized.">The attachment's attachment has herein been attachmentized.</button></div></div>
